      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹34.52 (down from ₹54.97 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹29.6b (up 15% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.04b (down 37% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.5% (down from 6.4% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) surpassed analyst estimates by 4.6%. Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 3% per year.",
